BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:osm-scouts-programme-8710106-Europe/London
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20250521T183000
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20250521T200000
SUMMARY:Nature Walk by the Hogsmill
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Nature Walk on Hogsmill (weather dependent)\nIf bad weather –
  we will have a games evening at the Den. If bad weather – we will let y
 ou know that the walk is not happening via the WhatsApp group on the day. 
 \nMeet 6.30pm \nWhat 3 Words ///cares.nods.hurls\nElmsbridge Meadows Open 
 Space by roundabout at bottom of Elmbridge Avenue / Raeburn Avenue / Surbi
 ton Hill Park\nWe will then walk along the Hogsmill and return to same loc
 ation for pick up at 8pm. \nCubs should wear uniform as normal with t – 
 shirt underneath. Cubs should wear trousers (due to how close we will be t
 o nature – stinging nettles / bugs etc. Please make sure footwear is app
 ropriate – if hot we will ask parents to take jumper home / not bring an
 d Cubs will only need to wear scarf as uniform during the walk. \nCubs may
  also need a coat dependent on weather conditions.  \nCubs should bring wa
 ter bottle with them.\nI will be the leader in charge and if emergency you
  will be able to contact me on my mobile – 07957 567 603.
DTSTAMP:20251008T111615Z
END:VEVENT
