BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:osm-scouts-programme-8718579-Europe/London
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20250625T183000
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20250625T200000
SUMMARY:Outdoor Games
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Outdoor Games / Play\nOur next meeting we planned to do an outd
 oor games evening at the Den. Sadly\, the lawn will not be cut in time so 
 we are instead going to Green Lane Recreation Ground for the evening. Plea
 se meet at the same location as the Hogsmill Nature Walk we did a few week
 s back. \n\nMeet 6.30pm \nWhat 3 Words ///cares.nods.hurls\nElmsbridge Mea
 dows Open Space by roundabout at bottom of Elmbridge Avenue / Raeburn Aven
 ue / Surbiton Hill Park\nPick up at 8pm\, as above.\n\nWe will then make o
 ur way to Green Lane Recreation Ground - a two minute walk - for an evenin
 g of games. Cubs will also have the opportunity to try the new upgraded pl
 ay park.  \n\nCubs do not need to wear uniform. Please make sure footwear 
 is appropriate – if hot and sunny please make sure sun cream is applied 
 and a hat or cap is available.   \nCubs MUST bring a drink with them. Make
  sure they have their water bottle with them.\nI will be the leader in cha
 rge and if emergency you will be able to contact me on my mobile – 07957
  567 603.
DTSTAMP:20251008T111615Z
END:VEVENT
