BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:osm-scouts-programme-8922765-Europe/London
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20251022T183000
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:OPAQUE
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20251022T200000
SUMMARY:Returning to the Hogsmill: Night Hike
CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:Night Hike on Hogsmill.\n\nThis walk is the same route as compl
 eted in daylight\, during the summer.\nUnless particularly bad weather\, w
 e will do the walk so please make sure Cubs are dressed appropriately for 
 the weather - dress for cold and / or wet as necessary  - Cubs should wear
  uniform as normal. Please make sure footwear is appropriate.  Cubs can be
 ing with them a torch. \n\nMeet 6.30pm \nWhat 3 Words ///cares.nods.hurls\
 nElmsbridge Meadows Open Space is by roundabout at bottom of Elmbridge Ave
 nue / Raeburn Avenue / Surbiton Hill Park\n\nWe will then walk along the H
 ogsmill and return to same location for pick up at 8pm. \nCubs should brin
 g water bottle with them.\nI will be the leader in charge and if emergency
  you will be able to contact me on my mobile – 07957 567 603\n\n.We will
  let you know that the walk is not happening via the WhatsApp group on the
  day.
DTSTAMP:20251008T111615Z
END:VEVENT
